\newlabel{tab:main}{{1}{4}{Synthetic results, $K=5$, $n_{\rm cal}=200$, 200 replicates. \emph {size}: mean pool size (fraction of reference targets inside the region; bold = smallest; 95\% CI half-widths 0.004--0.013), \emph {gap}: worst entropy-tercile coverage deviation $|{\rm cov}-0.9|$ (95\% bootstrap half-width $\le 0.006$). Coverage of every row is within $0.898$--$0.908$ (App.~\ref {app:tables}). $K{=}3,10$ and other $n_{\rm cal}$ in App.~\ref {app:tables}}{table.caption.2}{}}
